# Subagent Policy

- Delegate only to the project subagents defined in `.cursor/agents/`; enter them through the matching `/command` or by agent name.
- Never launch Cursor's built-in subagents (explore, bash/shell, browser, general-purpose). The `subagentStart` hook (`.cursor/hooks/subagent-gate.sh`) denies them; do not retry a denied spawn.
- If no project agent fits the task, do the work in the main conversation instead of spawning a subagent.
